{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"node-1","type":"text","x":-1200,"y":-400,"width":300,"height":100,"text":"# SolarWinds SUNBURST Attack Chain\n\n**Campaign:** SolarWinds Supply Chain Attack\n**Actor:** APT29 (NOBELIUM)\n**Period:** Sep 2019 - Dec 2020","fontSize":16,"color":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#ffeb3b"},
		{"id":"node-2","type":"file","x":-1200,"y":-100,"width":300,"height":400,"file":"CTI/Campaigns/SolarWinds Supply Chain Attack.md","subpath":""},
		{"id":"node-3","type":"file","x":-800,"y":-400,"width":300,"height":200,"file":"CTI/Threat Actors/APT29.md","subpath":""},
		{"id":"node-4","type":"file","x":-400,"y":-400,"width":300,"height":200,"file":"CTI/Malware/SUNBURST.md","subpath":""},
		{"id":"node-5","type":"file","x":-400,"y":-100,"width":300,"height":200,"file":"CTI/Malware/TEARDROP.md","subpath":""},
		{"id":"node-6","type":"file","x":-400,"y":200,"width":300,"height":200,"file":"CTI/Malware/RAINDROP.md","subpath":""},
		{"id":"node-7","type":"file","x":0,"y":-400,"width":300,"height":200,"file":"CTI/Tools/Cobalt Strike.md","subpath":""},
		{"id":"node-8","type":"file","x":0,"y":-100,"width":300,"height":200,"file":"CTI/Tools/Mimikatz.md","subpath":""},
		{"id":"node-9","type":"file","x":0,"y":200,"width":300,"height":200,"file":"CTI/Tools/Rubeus.md","subpath":""},
		{"id":"node-10","type":"text","x":-800,"y":200,"width":350,"height":300,"text":"## Attack Flow\n\n1. **Supply Chain Compromise** (T1195.002)\n   → SolarWinds build server compromised\n   → SUNBURST injected into Orion updates\n\n2. **Initial Access** (T1195.002)\n   → 18,000 orgs install compromised update\n   → SUNBURST executes on victim systems\n\n3. **Execution & Persistence**\n   → PowerShell (T1059.001)\n   → TEARDROP/RAINDROP loaders\n   → Cobalt Strike Beacon\n\n4. **Credential Access**\n   → Mimikatz (T1003.001)\n   → DCSync (T1003.006)\n   → Kerberoasting (T1558.003)\n\n5. **Lateral Movement**\n   → Pass-the-Hash (T1021.004)\n   → Pass-the-Ticket (T1550.003)\n\n6. **Cloud Pivot**\n   → Golden SAML / Azure AD token forgery\n   → Access Office 365 / Azure\n\n7. **Collection & Exfil**\n   → Email, source code, docs\n   → Exfil over C2 (T1041)","fontSize":14,"color":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#e3f2fd"},
		{"id":"node-11","type":"text","x":400,"y":-400,"width":350,"height":300,"text":"## Key IOCs\n\n**SUNBURST Hashes:**\n- a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678901234ab\n- b2c3d4e5f6a7890123456789012345bc\n\n**C2 Domains:**\n- avsvmcloud.com\n- deftsecurity.com\n- freescanonline.com\n- thedoccloud.com\n- highdatabase.com\n\n**C2 IPs:**\n- 203.0.113.45\n- 198.51.100.23\n- 192.0.2.67\n\n**TEARDROP/RAINDROP:**\n- Memory-only loaders\n- Load Cobalt Strike Beacon\n- No disk artifacts","fontSize":14,"color":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#ffebee"},
		{"id":"node-12","type":"text","x":400,"y":100,"width":350,"height":200,"text":"## Detection Opportunities\n\n**Network:**\n- DNS queries to C2 domains\n- HTTPS to unknown cloud IPs\n- Unusual outbound from Orion servers\n\n**Endpoint:**\n- SolarWinds.BusinessLayerHost.exe → PowerShell\n- Unsigned DLL loads (SUNBURST)\n- Cobalt Strike Beacon artifacts\n- Mimikatz LSASS access\n\n**Identity:**\n- DCSync replication requests\n- Golden SAML token anomalies\n- Azure AD token replay\n\n**Cloud:**\n- Unusual Azure AD app registrations\n- Suspicious OAuth consent grants\n- Cross-tenant access anomalies","fontSize":14,"color":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"#e8f5e9"},
		{"id":"node-13","type":"file","x":400,"y":300,"width":300,"height":200,"file":"CTI/IOCs/SolarWinds IOCs.md","subpath":""},
		{"id":"node-14","type":"file","x":400,"y":500,"width":300,"height":200,"file":"CTI/References/Microsoft SolarWinds Analysis.md","subpath":""},
		{"id":"node-15","type":"file","x":-800,"y":500,"width":300,"height":200,"file":"CTI/References/FireEye SUNBURST Analysis.md","subpath":""}
	],
